{
  "$comment": "ADR 016 example 2: text_to_speech with managed playback and with a retrievable audio artifact (ADR 017). status 'current': every request, result and terminal here validates against the committed schemas (packages/contracts/src/task-contract-fixtures.test.ts). The planner object is the projection onto route-planner-input's task (#243) that every SDK must produce for the request. 'invalidRequests' are requests the schema's per-kind rules reject; every SDK's request validation must reject each one too (the Web engine validates against the schema, Swift and Kotlin restate the rules in their task profiles). 'invalidPayloads' are JSON payloads the schema rejects that the Swift and Kotlin typed APIs cannot construct at all (unknown keys, unknown enum strings, another schema version); only the schema check sees them, so JSON entry points validate before decoding (ADR 025).",
  "task": "text_to_speech",
  "status": "current",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "playback_run",
      "description": "Managed playback: run() resolves when audible playback has finished. The result holds no bytes. The region in de-AT is a preference (localeMatch 'language'); the provider reports it used de-DE, which is a success.",
      "request": {
        "schemaVersion": "1.1",
        "task": {
          "kind": "text_to_speech"
        },
        "speech": {
          "text": "Der Bus kommt in fünf Minuten.",
          "locale": "de-AT",
          "localeMatch": "language",
          "voice": {
            "gender": "female",
            "requirement": "preferred"
          }
        },
        "delivery": {
          "mode": "playback"
        },
        "constraints": {
          "privacy": "local_required"
        },
        "modelProfile": "speech"
      },
      "result": {
        "schemaVersion": "1.1",
        "runId": "run_tts_1",
        "output": {
          "type": "playback",
          "playback": {
            "timing": {
              "durationMs": 2140,
              "firstAudioMs": 240,
              "firstChunkMs": 180
            }
          },
          "speech": {
            "locale": "de-DE",
            "voice": {
              "gender": "female"
            }
          }
        },
        "finishReason": "stop",
        "telemetry": {
          "providerUsed": "apple_system_speech",
          "totalMs": 2310
        }
      },
      "planner": {
        "kind": "text_to_speech",
        "inputs": [
          "text"
        ],
        "delivery": {
          "mode": "playback"
        },
        "locale": {
          "tag": "de-AT",
          "match": "language"
        },
        "voice": {
          "gender": "female",
          "requirement": "preferred"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "playback_cancelled",
      "description": "Cancelling a playback stream stops the audio; the terminal outcome is cancelled and carries the normalized output instead of partialText.",
      "request": {
        "schemaVersion": "1.1",
        "task": {
          "kind": "text_to_speech"
        },
        "speech": {
          "text": "Bitte steigen Sie an der nächsten Haltestelle aus.",
          "locale": "de-AT"
        },
        "delivery": {
          "mode": "playback"
        }
      },
      "terminal": {
        "schemaVersion": "1.1",
        "runId": "run_tts_2",
        "outcome": "cancelled",
        "output": {
          "type": "playback",
          "playback": {
            "timing": {
              "durationMs": 640
            }
          }
        },
        "reason": "consumer_cancelled"
      },
      "planner": {
        "kind": "text_to_speech",
        "inputs": [
          "text"
        ],
        "delivery": {
          "mode": "playback"
        },
        "locale": {
          "tag": "de-AT",
          "match": "language"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "artifact_run",
      "description": "Retrievable audio: run() resolves once the artifact is fully materialized and nothing is played. The media types and the exact locale are hard requirements.",
      "request": {
        "schemaVersion": "1.1",
        "task": {
          "kind": "text_to_speech"
        },
        "speech": {
          "text": "Your appointment is at 3 pm.",
          "locale": "en-GB",
          "localeMatch": "exact"
        },
        "delivery": {
          "mode": "artifact",
          "mediaTypes": [
            "audio/wav",
            "audio/mpeg"
          ]
        },
        "constraints": {
          "privacy": "cloud_allowed"
        }
      },
      "result": {
        "schemaVersion": "1.1",
        "runId": "run_tts_3",
        "output": {
          "type": "artifact",
          "artifact": {
